<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland appoints new Supreme court judge.</title>
<headline>Ireland appoints new Supreme court judge.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland nominated Mr. Justice Henry Denis Barron to fill a supreme court vacancy on the retirement of Mr.Justice Blayney.</p>
<p>Barron, the first member of the Jewish faith to be appointed to the supreme court in Ireland, will take up the mantle from Justice Blayney on March 14.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom +353 1 261 3377</p>
